Gain upper bound: 2.7698; optimality gap: <0.0001
Maximum constraint residual: <0.0001

Parental contributions (236 parents, 64 positive)
  Parent  Contribution
  218           0.0575
  176           0.0433
  44            0.0399
  119           0.0376
  137           0.0368
  85            0.0350
